<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee firms against dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee firms against dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee firmed against both the dollar and pound sterling on Monday, reflecting international market trends, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was posted at a commercial bank mean rate of 20.5555 to the dollar, from 20.6335 on last Friday, and at a 33.5905 to the pound from 33.6925 on Friday.</p>
<p>Clifford Vellien  ++230  211-9555</p>
